iOS 26 frontend + bridge: newFunctionWithDescriptor: keeps specializedName, so a stage's MTLLinkedFunctions links the function under that name (m2v-ios26/0001).
[V 23F84] RB::Device::RenderPipelineEntry::Loader::load_custom_fn and RB::Function::load_function: setName: <effect>, setSpecializedName: @"custom_fn". The first patch of this series dropped the name ("only labels"): that was wrong.
Without it RenderBox custom effects and shape masks have no pipeline: boot 11: custom_effect:clampToEdges_v1, primitive_custom:glow_v1, primitive_custom:simplifiedShapeAwareGradientMask_v1.

